{
  "imnb_version": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Raag Brindavani Sarang Composition - Saptak Music School - Ahmedabad"
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "96f7638d-4bf5-4c0b-8629-6feaac3f5bbd",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Raag Brindavani Sarang",
        "",
        "**Thaat:** Kafi  ",
        "**Vadi:** Re  ",
        "**Samvadi:** Pa  ",
        "**Time:** Afternoon (roughly 12:00 PM – 3:00 PM)",
        "",
        "Brindavani Sarang is a serene and melodic raga known for its calm, devotional, and soothing character.  ",
        "It is often associated with a peaceful afternoon mood and is commonly used in light classical forms.  ",
        "The raga omits **Ga** and **Dha**, and employs **Komal Ni** selectively, mainly in descent.",
        "",
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "030e1f06-8539-4db1-8a50-bbc5126d6a50",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 1. Basic Scale: Aroha & Avroha",
        "",
        "**Aroha:**  ",
        "Ni – Sa – Re – Ma – Pa – Ni – Sa’",
        "",
        "**Avroha:**  ",
        "Sa’ – Ni (komal) – Pa – Ma – Re – Sa – Ni – Sa",
        "",
        "**Aroha Notes:**  ",
        "- Uses Shuddha Ni (N)  ",
        "- Omitted notes: Ga, Dha  ",
        "",
        "**Avroha Notes:**  ",
        "- Uses Komal Ni (n)  ",
        "- Smooth and flowing descent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2104f78a-69c1-4ec9-8303-ec62cedd83cb",
      "cell_type": "music",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sargam-v1"
      },
      "source": [
        "@sa D4",
        "@raga BrindavaniSarang",
        "",
        "# Aroha (Ascent)",
        "N, S R M P N S' ||",
        "",
        "# Avroha (Descent)",
        "S' n P M R S N, S ||"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "33a3e531-119d-4537-8ed2-837e90ba933e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 2. Composition",
        "",
        "This section presents a Vilambit (slow tempo) composition set to the 16-beat rhythmic cycle known as Teentaal. ",
        "",
        "The melody allows for a detailed exploration of the raga's romantic temperament. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fe8f29b7-3e55-43e8-ac49-cdfa8750bad9",
      "cell_type": "music",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sargam-v1"
      },
      "source": [
        "@sa D4",
        "@tala Tintal(16)",
        "@tala_pattern dha dhin dhin dha | dha dhin dhin dha | dha tin tin ta | ta dhin dhin dha",
        "@tempo 50",
        "",
        "# Gat / Sthayi / Line 1",
        "/:11 n:0.5 n:0.5 P:0.5 ^:0.5 M:0.5 M:0.5 R:0.5 S:0.25 S:0.25 N,:0.5 S:0.5 ",
        "R:0.5 ^:0.5 R:0.5 ^:0.5 R:0.5 ^:0.5 S:0.5 S:0.5 R:0.5 ^:0.5 M:0.5 M:0.5 P:0.5 n:0.25 n:0.25 P:0.5 M:0.5 R:0.5 ^:0.5 N,:0.5 ^:0.5 S:0.5 ^:0.5 ||",
        "",
        "",
        "# Line 2",
        "/:11 R:0.5 R:0.5 S:0.5 ^:0.5  N,:0.5 S:0.5 n,:0.5 ^:0.5 P,:0.5 ^:0.5 ",
        "M,:0.5 P,:0.5 N,:0.5 ^:0.5 S:0.5 ^:0.5 N,:0.5 S:0.5 R:0.5 ^:0.5 M:0.5 M:0.5 P:0.25 N:0.25 S':0.5 n:0.5 P:0.5 M:0.5 R:0.5 N,:0.5 ^:0.5 S:0.5 ^:0.5",
        ""
      ]
    },
